OL,3,GNEWSASecurity guards will deter
OL,4,Amigrants, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity guards will be employed to
OL,7,F"provide reassurance to residents" in
OL,8,Fareas where asylum seekers frequently
OL,9,Fvisit, a council has said.
OL,11,FMDP Wethersfield, near Halstead in
OL,12,Fnorth Essex, has been used to house
OL,13,Fsingle male migrants since 2023 and the
OL,14,Fgovernment is looking to increase the
OL,15,Fnumber of people accommodated there
OL,16,Ffrom about 800 to 1,220.
OL,18,FEssex County Council said it planned to
OL,19,Fintroduce security personnel to
OL,20,FBraintree, Colchester and Chelmsford,
OL,21,Fwhere some of the migrants travel to by
OL,22,Fbus.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
